This corrected run encodes Candidate B Default/Write/Lock keys with the exact
production InternalKeyV1 format. The timed batch-32 commit restores 32 existing
locks and removes prior commit records in Criterion setup outside the timed
operation. Criterion's printed `change` fields compare against previously saved
Criterion baselines and are not used here as cross-version evidence; compare
the reported time estimates and physical summaries instead.

